;; kanmon 関門 — seed of high-stakes ENTRANCE-EXAM SYSTEMS (CN/KR/JP) under
;; barrier-load assessment. :sourcing :representative — these are REAL exam systems,
;; but the numeric factors (selectivity/single-shot/stakes/alt-pathways/transparency/
;; equity) and annual-candidates are ILLUSTRATIVE public-order-of-magnitude figures,
;; NOT precise official statistics. Precise live figures (倍率/受験者数 from the
;; ministry/test-body) are an operator/Council ingest step (G7). This is an OPENING
;; map of GATES, never a target-list and never a per-student record (G1/G2).
;;
;; factors ∈ 0..1:
;;   selectivity   competitiveness (few pass / high 倍率)
;;   single-shot   one-exam/one-day/no-retake intensity
;;   stakes        breadth of life-opportunity the gate controls
;;   alt-pathways  availability of ALTERNATIVE admission routes (high = more open)
;;   transparency  how public/legible the scoring & criteria are (high = more open)
;;   equity        evenness of access across region/income (low = concentrated)
;; barrier-load = selectivity · (0.5+0.5·single-shot) · (0.5+0.5·stakes)
[
 ;; ── 中国 CN ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 {:type :exam :id "cn-gaokao" :name "普通高等学校招生全国统一考试 (高考 / gaokao)"
  :country :cn :body :synthetic-moe-cn :kind :university-entrance :annual-candidates 13000000
  :selectivity 0.7 :single-shot 0.95 :stakes 0.95 :alt-pathways 0.2 :transparency 0.6 :equity 0.35
  :subjects [:chinese :math :foreign-language :comprehensive]
  :note "The canonical one-shot life-gate: a single two-day exam largely determines university placement → :destake (reduce one-shot dependence)."}
 {:type :exam :id "cn-zhongkao" :name "初中学业水平考试 (中考 / zhongkao)"
  :country :cn :body :synthetic-moe-cn :kind :secondary-entrance :annual-candidates 12000000
  :selectivity 0.6 :single-shot 0.85 :stakes 0.65 :alt-pathways 0.3 :transparency 0.55 :equity 0.3
  :subjects [:chinese :math :foreign-language :science :pe]
  :note "普职分流 (academic/vocational split) at 15; strong urban/rural disparity → :equity-watch."}
 {:type :exam :id "cn-kaoyan" :name "全国硕士研究生招生考试 (考研 / kaoyan)"
  :country :cn :body :synthetic-moe-cn :kind :postgraduate-entrance :annual-candidates 4000000
  :selectivity 0.8 :single-shot 0.75 :stakes 0.6 :alt-pathways 0.3 :transparency 0.5 :equity 0.5
  :subjects [:politics :foreign-language :major-1 :major-2]
  :note "Surging competition + degree-inflation, few alternative routes to graduate study → :open-pathway."}
 {:type :exam :id "cn-zizhao" :name "综合评价/强基计划 (comprehensive-evaluation admission)"
  :country :cn :body :synthetic-moe-cn :kind :university-entrance :annual-candidates 200000
  :selectivity 0.7 :single-shot 0.5 :stakes 0.6 :alt-pathways 0.5 :transparency 0.3 :equity 0.4
  :subjects [:portfolio :interview :school-assessment]
  :note "Discretionary comprehensive-evaluation track with opaque selection criteria → :transparency-gap (route to disclosure)."}

 ;; ── 韓国 KR ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 {:type :exam :id "kr-suneung" :name "대학수학능력시험 (수능 / CSAT / Suneung)"
